  "description": "The VTUVIA Giraffe Commuter Step-Thru Electric Bike, equipped with a torque sensor, enhances its responsiveness and efficiency during acceleration and climbing. The addition of the torque sensor improves the riding experience by automatically adjusting motor output based on the rider's pedal force, providing a more natural feel.\nThis electric bike is especially well-suited for urban commuting thanks to its step-thru design, which allows riders to easily mount and dismount, an ideal feature for those dressed in everyday work attire. Furthermore, the robust 500W motor ensures ample power for handling heavier loads or uphill stretches, while the 48V 14Ah high-capacity battery supports extended distances without frequent recharging.\nTypically, this model also includes additional practical features such as front and rear lights, a multi-functional LCD display, and a sturdy luggage rack, all of which offer extra convenience and safety for daily commuters. Whether it's for daily commutes or leisurely weekend rides, the VTUVIA Giraffe Commuter Step-Thru Electric Bike provides an eco-friendly and healthy transportation option.",
